">Placement · Nov 6</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#included-person\">See included under</a></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9\"/><path d=\"M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>Alex Rivera was invited to Mosko Holdings as a viewer.</strong> Mosko Holdings includes your entities Mosko (Person), through The Moskos, and Mosko Consulting LLC.</p><div class=\"consent-text\"><p>Members of Mosko Holdings, and of any parent above it, see class and category totals for this entity for any period.</p><p>For a small entity, that effectively reveals individual amounts and their dates.</p><p>Nothing else is shown: no payee, memo, account or counterparty.</p></div><div class=\"notice-meta\">New member on a parent above you · Nov 7</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#included-person\">See included under</a></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><line x1=\"19\" x2=\"19\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"14\"/><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"11\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>Sam Mosko asks to invite jo@example.com to The Moskos as a manager.</strong> The invite is sent once every other owner approves.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Approval request · requested Nov 7 · expires Nov 21 unless every owner approves</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Approve</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Decline</button></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>Reminder: 7 days left</strong> to answer Sam Mosko's request to change The Moskos' cap table from Dec 1, 2026.</p><p class=\"notice-meta\">A request nobody answers expires as declined on Nov 21.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Approval request · day 7</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Approve</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Decline</button></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"/><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>Sam Mosko declined your request</strong> to remove them as an owner of The Moskos.</p><p class=\"notice-meta\">As the founding owner you may force it. Sam Mosko and every other owner are told.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Request declined · Nov 9</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Force removal</button></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>Every remaining owner has approved</strong> your request to invite jo@example.com to The Moskos. One approver stopped being an owner before it applied, so it waits for you to confirm.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Waiting for you · an approver left before it applied</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Confirm and send</button><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Withdraw</button></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9\"/><path d=\"M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>A holder on Mosko Holdings' cap table was purged.</strong> It now reads \"Former holder (purged Oct 2, 2026)\", and its 15 units count as outside owners from that date. You may add a label of your own.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Former holder · Oct 2</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#notices-ref\">Open cap table</a></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>You are now a manager of The Moskos.</strong> Set up a second sign-in step to start; until then you keep viewer access.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Role raised · as Lee Mosko receives it · Nov 7</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" href=\"/settings#second-step\">Set up second step</a></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"/><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>A second owner joined Mosko Consulting LLC, so the raise you made alone for Lee Mosko was cancelled.</strong> Raise it again and the owners will approve it.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Raise cancelled · Nov 12</div></div><div class=\"notice-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" href=\"#notices-ref\">See members</a></div></li>\n<li class=\"notice\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"/><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"/></svg></span><div class=\"notice-body\"><p><strong>Mosko cancelled your raise of Lee Mosko to manager of The Moskos.</strong> Lee Mosko keeps viewer access.</p><div class=\"notice-meta\">Raise cancelled · as Sam Mosko receives it · Nov 12</div></div></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"tm-note\">Notifications open from the avatar popover. Approve, Decline, Force removal and Confirm each ask for the second step first. Pending requests, including an invitee's email, are shown to owners only.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Add to a parent — confirmation (reference)</span>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Include Mosko Consulting LLC in The Moskos?\" style=\"max-width:560px;\"><div class=\"je-modal-title\">Include Mosko Consulting LLC in The Moskos?</div><div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">You own both entities, so this applies at once.</div><div class=\"consent-text\"><p>Members of The Moskos, and of any parent above it, see class and category totals for this entity for any period.</p><p>For a small entity, that effectively reveals individual amounts and their dates.</p><p>Nothing else is shown: no payee, memo, account or counterparty.</p></div><p class=\"card-sub\">If The Moskos is later placed inside another parent, that parent's members see the same totals, and you are told. You can remove the link at any time from Included under.</p><div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Include in The Moskos</button></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Invite member, multi-owner entity (reference). On a sole-owner entity the subtitle is gone and the button reads Send invite.</span>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Invite a member to The Moskos\" style=\"max-width:560px;\"><div class=\"je-modal-title\">Invite a member to The Moskos</div><div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">The Moskos has two owners, so the invite is sent after Sam Mosko approves.</div><div class=\"form-row\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"inv-email\">Email</label><input id=\"inv-email\" class=\"input\" type=\"email\" value=\"jo@example.com\"></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"inv-role\">Role</label><select id=\"inv-role\" class=\"select\"><option>Viewer</option><option selected>Manager</option><option>Owner</option></select></div></div><p class=\"card-sub\">Owners and managers set up a second sign-in step when they join. Every other owner has 14 days to answer, with a reminder at day 7; a request nobody answers expires as declined. Owners of every entity this parent includes are told when the invite is sent.</p><div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Request invite</button></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Force removal — confirmation (reference). Offered only to the founder, only on a declined or expired request to remove or demote a co-owner.</span>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Force Sam Mosko's removal from The Moskos?\" style=\"max-width:560px;\"><div class=\"je-modal-title\">Force Sam Mosko's removal from The Moskos?</div><div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">Sam Mosko declined this request on Nov 9.</div><p class=\"card-sub\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">As the founding owner you can apply it anyway. Sam Mosko loses owner access at once. Sam Mosko and every other owner are notified, and the change is recorded in the audit log. You confirm with your second step.</p><div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Force removal</button></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Transfer founder — confirmation (reference)</span>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Transfer the founder role for The Moskos\" style=\"max-width:560px;\"><div class=\"je-modal-title\">Transfer the founder role for The Moskos</div><div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">The founder may force a co-owner removal or demotion after it is declined or expires. Nothing else changes: you stay an owner.</div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"tf-to\">New founding owner</label><select id=\"tf-to\" class=\"select\"><option>Sam Mosko</option></select></div><p class=\"card-sub\">Only current owners are listed. Every owner is notified. You confirm with your second step.</p><div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Transfer founder</button></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Cancel raise — confirmation (reference). Offered to every owner on a held raise's row; a lowering, so no approval.</span>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Cancel Lee Mosko's raise to manager?\" style=\"max-width:560px;\"><div class=\"je-modal-title\">Cancel Lee Mosko's raise to manager?</div><div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">Lee Mosko keeps viewer access.</div><p class=\"card-sub\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">The raise has waited for Lee Mosko's second step since Nov 7. Cancelling needs no approval. Sam Mosko, who raised it, is notified. You confirm with your second step.</p><div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Keep the raise</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel raise</button></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Cap table — refusals on save (reference)</span>\n      <div class=\"cap-refusals\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"ref-total\">Total units</label><input id=\"ref-total\" class=\"input input-pct\" type=\"text\" value=\"80\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ref-total-err\"><div class=\"cap-error\" id=\"ref-total-err\">Can't save: units exceed the total on Jan 1, 2026.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"field-label\">Add holder: Mosko Consulting LLC, on Family Trust</span><div class=\"cap-error\">Can't save: this would make an entity its own holder.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><span class=\"field-label\">Add holder: Family Trust, on an entity already held by Mosko Consulting LLC</span><div class=\"cap-error\">Can't save: ownership chains deeper than one entity aren't supported yet.</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"tm-note\">Nothing is saved when a check fails; the editor stays open with the entries as typed. A message never names an entity the editor cannot see.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Create a new entity</div>\n      <div class=\"form-row\">\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"new-entity\">Entity name</label><input id=\"new-entity\" class=\"input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Family Trust\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"new-type\">Type</label><select id=\"new-type\" class=\"select\"><option>Person</option><option>Trust</option><option>Business</option><option>Household</option><option>Holding</option></select></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label for=\"new-tax\">Tax classification</label><select id=\"new-tax\" class=\"select\"><option>Individual</option><option>Trust, non-grantor</option><option>Trust, grantor</option><option>Business, pass-through</option><option>Business, C-corp</option><option>Pass-through to members</option><option>Joint filers</option></select></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"M12 5v14\"/></svg></span>Create entity</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"entity-section\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\"><div class=\"cap-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Cap table</span><span class=\"card-sub\">Shown for a Trust, Business, Household or Holding</span></div>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"data-table cap-table\" aria-label=\"New entity cap table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Holder or member</th><th scope=\"col\">Access</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"num\">Units</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"cap-holder\"><span class=\"avatar\">M</span><span>You<span class=\"cap-sub\">Mosko (Person)</span></span></span></td><td><span class=\"badge badge-default\">Owner</span></td><td class=\"num\"><input class=\"input input-pct\" type=\"text\" value=\"100\" aria-label=\"New entity, units held by you\"> <span class=\"card-sub\">100%</span></td></tr><tr class=\"cap-add\"><td colspan=\"3\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\"><span class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"M12 5v14\"/></svg></span>Add holder</button></td></tr><tr class=\"cap-outside\"><td>Outside owners<span class=\"cap-sub\">Computed: the total less every holder</span></td><td>—</td><td class=\"num\">0 <span class=\"card-sub\">0%</span></td></tr><tr class=\"cap-total\"><td>Total units</td><td></td><td class=\"num\"><input class=\"input input-pct\" type=\"text\" value=\"100\" aria-label=\"New entity, total units\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n        <span class=\"card-sub\">A new entity starts at 100 units, all held by you from the day it is created. Change it here or later on its card.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:24px;\" id=\"second-step-first\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Create entity, no second step yet (reference): three steps in one dialog, password, the emailed code, then the method. The same dialog opens before the first invite to your own Person, and before export, purge, granting access and linking a bank. Deleting the account asks for the password and the emailed code only (Settings).</span>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Set up a second step first, step 1 of 3\" style=\"max-width:520px;\">\n        <div class=\"je-modal-title\">Set up a second step first</div>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">Creating Family Trust makes you its owner. Owners confirm sign-ins with a second step, so a stolen password alone can't reach the books.</div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Step 1 of 3 · Your password</p>\n        <div class=\"auth-field\"><label for=\"gate-pw\">Password</label><input id=\"gate-pw\" class=\"input\" type=\"password\" value=\"••••••••••••\"></div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Signed in with Google or GitHub? You are sent to that provider to sign in again in place of the password.</p>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Continue</button></div>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Set up a second step first, step 2 of 3\" style=\"max-width:520px;\">\n        <div class=\"je-modal-title\">Set up a second step first</div>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">Creating Family Trust makes you its owner. Owners confirm sign-ins with a second step, so a stolen password alone can't reach the books.</div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Step 2 of 3 · Check your email</p>\n        <p>We sent a code to <span class=\"mono\">m•••@example.com</span>. This confirms it's really you before your first second step is set up.</p>\n        <div class=\"auth-field\"><label for=\"gate-email-code\">Code from the email</label><input id=\"gate-email-code\" class=\"input code-input\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" maxlength=\"6\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"000000\"></div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">This code works for 10 minutes, once, in this window. Didn't get it? Check spam, or <a class=\"je-link\" href=\"#\">resend the code</a>.</p>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Continue</button></div>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Set up a second step first, step 2 of 3, code not accepted\" style=\"max-width:520px;\">\n        <div class=\"je-modal-title\">Set up a second step first</div>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">Creating Family Trust makes you its owner. Owners confirm sign-ins with a second step, so a stolen password alone can't reach the books.</div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Step 2 of 3 · Check your email — the code was not accepted</p>\n        <p>We sent a code to <span class=\"mono\">m•••@example.com</span>. This confirms it's really you before your first second step is set up.</p>\n        <div class=\"auth-field\"><label for=\"gate-email-code-err\">Code from the email</label><input id=\"gate-email-code-err\" class=\"input code-input\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" maxlength=\"6\" value=\"482913\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"gate-email-code-msg\"><div class=\"cap-error\" id=\"gate-email-code-msg\" role=\"alert\">That code is wrong or has expired. Check the latest email, or resend the code. After 5 wrong tries a code stops working.</div></div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Didn't get it? Check spam, or <a class=\"je-link\" href=\"#\">resend the code</a>. A new code replaces the last one.</p>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Continue</button></div>\n      </div></div>\n      <div class=\"je-modal-scrim\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\"><div class=\"je-modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"Set up a second step first, step 3 of 3\" style=\"max-width:520px;\">\n        <div class=\"je-modal-title\">Set up a second step first</div>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-subtitle\">Creating Family Trust makes you its owner. Owners confirm sign-ins with a second step, so a stolen password alone can't reach the books.</div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Step 3 of 3 · Choose your second step</p>\n        <div class=\"factor-choice\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Second step method\">\n          <div class=\"fork-card\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"icon icon-sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/></svg></span> Authenticator app</div><p>A 6-digit code from an app on your phone. Works on every device.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"fork-card\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"icon icon-sm\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"/><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span> Passkey</div><p>Touch ID, Face ID or a security key on this device.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"enrol-row\"><div class=\"qr-box\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"QR code for your authenticator app\"></div><div>Scan this with your authenticator app, or enter the key by hand:<div class=\"mono\" style=\"margin-top:6px;color:var(--foreground);\">JBSW Y3DP EHPK 3PXP</div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"auth-field\"><label for=\"gate-code\">Enter the 6-digit code it shows</label><input id=\"gate-code\" class=\"input code-input\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" maxlength=\"6\" placeholder=\"000000\"></div>\n        <p class=\"card-sub\">Next you get ten backup codes to keep somewhere safe, then Family Trust is created. Setting up counts as your fresh check: an export, purge, grant or bank link goes ahead without asking again for 5 minutes.</p>\n        <div class=\"je-modal-footer\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Turn on and continue</button></div>\n      </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </main>";
